OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire sees 9,700 solar
OL,4,Ainstallations this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FA record-breaking 9,700 solar
OL,7,Finstallations were fitted in Yorkshire
OL,8,Fand the Humber in the first half of
OL,9,Fthis year, the government has said.
OL,11,FAccording to the Department for Energy
OL,12,FSecurity and Net Zero, this represents
OL,13,Fenough energy to power the equivalent
OL,14,Fof up to 16,300 homes.
OL,16,FIt builds on the 9,300 solar
OL,17,Finstallations fitted in the same period
OL,18,Fin 2025.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
