OL,3,GNEWSAYorkshire sees 9,700 solar
OL,4,Ainstallations this year
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Skaith, Mayor of York and North
OL,7,FYorkshire, said: "Thousands of families
OL,8,Fand businesses across Yorkshire are
OL,9,Fbenefiting from solar, helping to bring
OL,10,Fdown their bills, build our county's
OL,11,Fenergy security and put power back into
OL,12,Fthe hands of local people."
